@startuml ZAI Orders Management
!theme plain
title ZAI E-commerce Platform - Order Management Use Cases (Sprint 3)

left to right direction

actor Client
actor "ZAI Admin" as Admin
actor "Dolibarr System" as Dolibarr

rectangle "ZAI Order Management" {
  usecase "Create Order" as UC1
  usecase "Process Payment" as UC2
  usecase "View Order History" as UC3
  usecase "Track Order Status" as UC4
  usecase "Manage Shipping Address" as UC5
  usecase "Apply Discount Code" as UC6
  usecase "Cancel Order" as UC7
}

rectangle "ZAI Admin Functions" {
  usecase "Validate Order" as ADMIN1
  usecase "Update Order Status" as ADMIN2
  usecase "Generate Invoice" as ADMIN3
  usecase "Process Refund" as ADMIN4
  usecase "Manage Returns" as ADMIN5
}

rectangle "Dolibarr Integration" {
  usecase "Sync Customer Data" as DOL1
  usecase "Update Product Stock" as DOL2
  usecase "Generate Dolibarr Invoice" as DOL3
  usecase "Track Shipment" as DOL4
}

' Client interactions
Client --> UC1 : creates
Client --> UC2 : pays
Client --> UC3 : views
Client --> UC4 : tracks
Client --> UC5 : manages
Client --> UC6 : applies
Client --> UC7 : requests

' Admin interactions
Admin --> ADMIN1 : validates
Admin --> ADMIN2 : updates
Admin --> ADMIN3 : generates
Admin --> ADMIN4 : processes
Admin --> ADMIN5 : handles
Admin --> UC4 : monitors

' Dolibarr system interactions
Dolibarr --> DOL1 : synchronizes
Dolibarr --> DOL2 : updates
Dolibarr --> DOL3 : creates
Dolibarr --> DOL4 : provides

' Use case relationships
UC1 ..> UC2 : includes
UC1 ..> UC5 : may include
UC1 ..> UC6 : may include
UC2 ..> ADMIN1 : triggers
ADMIN1 ..> DOL1 : activates
ADMIN1 ..> DOL3 : generates
ADMIN2 ..> DOL4 : updates
UC7 ..> ADMIN4 : may trigger

' ZAI-specific notes
note right of UC1
  Converts ZAI cart to order
  using Dolibarr product data
  and customer information
end note

note right of DOL1
  Synchronizes with Dolibarr
  llx_societe and llx_user
  tables for customer data
end note

note right of DOL2
  Updates Dolibarr llx_product
  and llx_stock tables
  for inventory management
end note

note right of DOL3
  Creates entries in Dolibarr
  llx_commande and
  llx_commandedet tables
end note

@enduml